      "role": "user",
      "content": "i think i messed everything up. i just found out my entire dataset for the dissertation is corrupted. like, actually gone. i've spent four years on this and there is no way to fix it. i can't even look at my advisor or my lab mates without feeling like a complete fraud. it feels like my whole life was built on nothing and there's just no point in trying to rebuild it now.",
