      "content": "\"face the darkness\" ... is that what you mean? it just feels like the path is closed. there's no coming back from this. i don't even want to try to fix the lie, i just want the feeling of being a failure to stop. it's like i'm just waiting for the inevitable collapse. do you think there's even any point in trying to keep going when the core of who i am is just... nothing?",
